python3-markdown
# python3-yaml: PyYAML — the ONLY third-party dependency of the vendored
# nucleotide package (roadmap #89, DEC-PHASE12-012). System package, no pip.
python3-yaml
# Pivotglass runtime deps (roadmap #90, DEC-PHASE12-013) — 8 of its 9 declared
