python3-tomli-w
python3-requests
python3-pytz
python3-simplejson
# python3-prompt-toolkit: Pivotglass's `agent` extra — powers `ap tui`/`ap chat`
# (the terminal deck) and REPL line editing. Its sibling extra litellm is large,
# pip-only and API-oriented, so it is deliberately NOT shipped (trim); it could
# later target the local Nebula/ollama endpoint. (DEC-PHASE12-013)
python3-prompt-toolkit
# python3-pymdownx: PyMdown extensions — `superfences` renders code fences nested
# inside list items, which stock python-markdown collapses into inline <code>
