# Libraries and dependencies
libimage-exiftool-perl
# perl: P1-002 (QA_AUDIT_2026-07-21). shasum (from libdigest-sha-perl) is used by
# download-samples.sh:178-181 for checksum verification. Adding perl ensures the full
# Perl runtime is present; libdigest-sha-perl is a Perl module, so perl is the root dep.
perl
# python3-pip: pip package manager required by hook 0500-install-external-tools.hook.chroot
# to install matrix-commander and capa into their respective venvs. Without this package
# in the base image the hook's hard-fail path (DEC-PHASE11-018) triggers immediately
# because pip is unavailable.
python3-pip
# python3-venv: REQUIRED for `python3 -m venv` to produce a venv containing pip.
#
# W11-13 assumed python3-pip pulls python3-venv transitively. It does NOT — verified
# against bullseye:
#   python3-pip Depends: ca-certificates, python3-distutils, python3-setuptools,
#                        python3-wheel, python-pip-whl, python3:any
# With python3-venv absent, `python3 -m venv` still creates bin/python* but ensurepip
# fails, so the venv has NO pip. Hook 0500 then skipped its install block entirely
# (the `if [ -f .../bin/pip ]` guard was false), which made the DEC-PHASE11-018
# hard-fail unreachable and shipped EMPTY venvs while the build exited 0 — the exact
# silent-empty-venv defect DEC-PHASE11-018 exists to prevent. Proven on the
# 2026-08-07 build: /opt/orionx/venv/{re,comms}/bin contained only python,python3,
# python3.9 — no pip, no capa, no matrix-commander.
python3-venv
python3-numpy
python3-scapy

